- [x] The theme is the brand guide's, in light and in dark: the warm greys, the flame as the one accent, a colour for every state. A colour changes by its use, never one by one on a screen. Done, 2026-11-14: `web/src/index.css`, with each value read from the boards Foundations and Dark. `tests/web/brand.test.ts` holds that no screen or part sets a colour, a size of text, a weight or a shadow of its own, and that each use has its value in light and in dark.
